      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "misogynistic_humor",
      "label": "Misogynistic Humor",
      "description": "The meme is an example of misogynistic humor, which uses crude, degrading, or objectifying jokes about women to provoke laughter. This type of humor reinforces harmful stereotypes and devalues women by reducing them to their sexual behavior or reproductive potential. The humor in this meme is derived from the juxtaposition of the sexualized image and the degrading commentary on women's roles, which is intended to be funny but is rooted in misogyny.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
