      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_e2b5c363",
      "@type": "AnalogicalMapping",
      "instance_name": "mapping_1",
      "label": "Woman is mapped as the subject of the sexualized command",
      "description": "The top text 'when she says \"don't cum in me\"' explicitly refers to the woman in the image as 'she'. The visual entity 'woman' is thus mapped onto the textual entity 'she' in the phrase, establishing an analogical mapping where the woman is the referent for the pronoun 'she'.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
